1
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:03,633
-嘿 -嘿

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:09,260
Oh, my God, you cleaned! Look at these floors!
天啊，你打掃過了 看看地板

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:13,270
You did the windows! I have been begging you for months! And you did, you cleaned.
你還擦了窗戶 我跟你提了好幾個月，你真的打掃了

4
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:18,570
-And nagging works! -No, I didn't actually do this.
-嘮叨是有用的 -不，事實上這不是我做的

5
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:22,550
Oh, no. Was I cleaning in my sleep again?
不 我又邊睡覺邊打掃了？

6
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,250
No, it wasn't you.
不，打掃的人也不是你

7
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:28,180
-Well, then, who? -I got a maid. Yay!
-那麼是誰？ -我請了一個女傭，耶

8
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:34,290
I hope by "maid" you mean "mistress" because if some other woman was cleaning..
我希望你說的「女傭」是指「情婦」 因為有其他女人在打掃…

9
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:38,060
Now, honey, I know you don't like to relinquish control.
甜心，我知道你不喜歡 讓出控制權

10
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,740
"Relinquish" is just a fancy word for "lose."
「讓出」的意思 應該就是「失去」吧

11
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:48,400
She's nice, and she mentioned that she adored the way you arranged the sponges.
她真的很棒，她還說 她喜歡你放海綿的方式

12
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,740
Did she really say that?
她真的那麼說？

13
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:54,680
Yes, I distinctly remember because I thought it was a joke.
對，我會記得 因為我以為她在開玩笑

14
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:59,050
-Now, just give her a chance, okay? -Fine, I can do it.
-給她一個機會，好嗎？ -好吧，我辦得到的

15
00:01:00,890 --> 00:01:05,920
-What's the matter? -Usually when I'm this anxious, I clean.
-怎麼了？ -通常我一焦慮就會打掃

16
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,959
The One With The Stain
本集播出：有污點的那個

00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:10,959
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

17
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:51,070
Whose cell phone is that? It's just so annoying. Everywhere you go.
是誰的行動電話在響？ 那真的很吵，走到哪裡都會發生這種事

18
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:54,140
I think it's coming from your bag.
我想聲音是從你的包包裡傳出來的

19
00:01:56,110 --> 00:01:58,940
I never get calls!
從來沒有人會打電話給我

20
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:00,810
Hello?
喂

21
00:02:01,050 --> 00:02:07,180
Hi, it's Eric, from the Halloween party. Ursula's fiance.
嗨，我是萬聖節派對上的艾力克 烏蘇拉的未婚夫

22
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:10,980
Oh, my God, Eric, hi! Wait, how'd you get this number?
天啊，艾力克，嗨 等一下，你怎麼知道我的電話號碼？

23
00:02:11,190 --> 00:02:14,420
I have a friend who's a cop, and he got it for me.
我有個朋友在當警察 他幫我查到的

24
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:19,690
Wow. What an incredible violation and wonderful surprise!
那真的是太不可思議了 我嚇了一大跳

26
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:22,990
Listen, I just.. I thought you should know I broke up with Ursula.
我想你應該知道 我跟烏蘇拉分手了

27
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:25,970
Oh, you did? He did it, he did it!
是嗎？他辦到了

28
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:29,610
-What did he do? -I'm talking!
-他做了什麼？ -我在講電話

29
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:36,810
Anyway, I was wondering if you were the sort of person who eats lunch?
總之我很好奇 你會不會吃午餐？

30
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,610
Are you asking me out?
你是在約我嗎？

31
00:02:39,850 --> 00:02:44,310
Because it'd be kind of weird since you just broke up with my sister.
因為那很奇怪 你剛剛才跟我姐姐分手

32
00:02:44,530 --> 00:02:49,230
Yeah, okay. I'm sorry. Bye.
好吧，抱歉，再見

33
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:53,370
No, no. Wait! I was just saying that so you'd think I was a good person.
不，等一下，我會那麼做 是希望你把我當成好人

34
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,490
Fight for me.
為我奮鬥吧

35
00:02:58,540 --> 00:03:00,470
I won't take "no" for an answer.
我不會接受你的拒絕

36
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:03,200
Not great, but we can work on it at lunch.
雖然不是很好 但我們能邊吃午餐邊練習

37
00:03:03,410 --> 00:03:06,710
I can be at your apartment in two hours.
我可以在兩個小時裡 趕到你家

38
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:09,350
Great. How do you know where I live?
太棒了，你怎麼知道我住在哪裡？

39
00:03:09,550 --> 00:03:12,150
I've got friends too.
我也有朋友

40
00:03:12,350 --> 00:03:13,620
Okay, bye.
好吧，再見

41
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:16,880
Oh, my God, I'm going out with Eric!
天啊，我要跟艾力克約會

42
00:03:17,130 --> 00:03:21,760
This day is really gonna be so much better than I thought it was gonna be.
今天比我想像中還要美好

43
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:24,860
Oh, Ross, I can't make lunch.
羅斯，我沒辦法跟你吃午餐

44
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:30,400
So apparently I'm available for lunch.
很明顯地 我午餐時間有空

45
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,230
I can't. I'm busy. I'm apartment hunting.
我沒辦法，我很忙 我在找房子

46
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,930
You're moving?
你要搬家？

47
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:38,200
I can't live with Joey once the baby comes.
孩子生下來後 我沒辦法跟喬伊一起住

48
00:03:38,450 --> 00:03:43,180
I don't want my child's first words to be, "How you doing?"
我不希望我的孩子會說的第一句話 是「你好嗎？」

49
00:03:44,050 --> 00:03:46,040
So does Joey know you're moving?
喬伊知道你要搬家嗎？

50
00:03:46,250 --> 00:03:49,190
I haven't discussed it with him, but I know he'll be relieved.
我還沒有跟他談 但我知道他會覺得如釋重負

51
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:54,290
Last week, he brought this girl over, and I talked to her about morning sickness.
上星期他帶一個女孩回家 我跟她談害喜的問題

52
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,890
Then I showed her pictures from my pregnancy book.
還把我懷孕紀念冊的照片 拿給她看

53
00:03:57,100 --> 00:04:00,730
-That's not really porn? -Not so much.
-那不會很煽情嗎？ -一點都沒有

54
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:07,070
I heard in the elevator this morning that a woman in my building died.
今天早上我在電梯裡聽說 我住的公寓裡有個女住戶過世了

55
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:13,240
Oh, my God. Was she old? Does she have a view?
天啊，她很老嗎？ 她的公寓景觀好嗎？

56
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:18,050
I don't know, but how great would that be? You living in my building?
我不知道，但那一定會很棒 你搬到我的公寓裡來

57
00:04:18,290 --> 00:04:22,280
I could take care of the baby, I could come over whenever I want..
我可以照顧寶寶 想過去就過去…

58
00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:24,050
with your permission.
當然得先得到你的允許

59
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:28,250
That really would be great. Well, can we see it?
那真的很棒 我們能去看看嗎？

60
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:32,060
Maybe we shouldn't. I mean, if she just died this morning.
或許我們不該那麼做 我是說她今天早上才過世

61
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:35,600
Yeah. No. No, you're right.
對，不，你說的對

62
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:41,810
-Shall we? -Yeah.
-可以嗎？ -好吧

63
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:50,910
Yes?
有什麼事嗎？

64
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:54,110
Hi. I'm Ross Geller. I live in the building.
嗨，我是羅斯蓋勒 我住在這棟公寓裡

65
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:58,920
And I'm Rachel, an admirer of the building.
我是瑞秋 我很喜歡這棟公寓

66
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:05,360
I heard about Mrs. Verhoeven passing away, and I am so sorry for your loss.
聽說佛哈芬太太過世了 我真的很遺憾

67
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,830
-She didn't pass away. -What?
-她沒有過世 -什麼？

68
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:12,670
-My mother's still alive. -Oh, thank God!
-我媽媽還活著 -謝天謝地

69
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:19,340
It looked like we were gonna lose her this morning, but she's a tough old bird.
她今天早上差點就過世了 但她是個意志力很強的老太婆

70
00:05:19,550 --> 00:05:21,240
Are you close with her?
你跟她很熟嗎？

71
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:26,010
Of course. She and I would talk all the time..
當然，我們常常…

72
00:05:26,250 --> 00:05:29,450
in the laundry room.
在洗衣間聊天

73
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:32,290
You speak Dutch?
你會說荷蘭文？

74
00:05:31,331 --> 00:05:35,199
（荷蘭語）

75
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:42,500
You know, I would, but it's just too painful.
我會的 但那太痛苦了

76
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:46,470
So she's really not dead.
她真的沒死

77
00:05:46,670 --> 00:05:50,010
No. She's hanging in there.
不，她還在裡面

78
00:05:50,210 --> 00:05:56,150
Could you tell me, is she hanging in in a one-bedroom or a two?
你能告訴我她住的公寓 是一房還是兩房嗎？

79
00:05:59,690 --> 00:06:03,780
Mrs. Bing, this tile cleaner is incredible. Where did you get it?
賓太太，這個清潔劑太棒了 你在哪裡買的？

80
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:07,150
Oh, well.. I make it myself.
喔… 那是我自己做的

81
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:12,560
It's two parts ammonia and one part lemon juice. The secret ingredient is..
兩份的阿摩尼亞加一份的檸檬汁 秘方是…

82
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,860
You know what? We just met.
你知道嗎？我們才剛剛認識

83
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:20,060
Okay. I'm gonna go get the clothes from the laundry room now.
好吧，我去洗衣間拿衣服

84
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:22,870
When I come back, I'll clean behind the refrigerator.
我回來後 會打掃冰箱後面

85
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,740
I love her.
我愛她

86
00:06:26,550 --> 00:06:29,020
I'll be back in a minute.
我馬上回來

87
00:06:29,850 --> 00:06:31,820
Okay.
好吧

88
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:36,510
-See? I told you. -She stole my jeans!
-看吧？我告訴過你 -她偷了我的牛仔褲

89
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:39,850
What?
什麼？

90
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:43,190
I've been looking for them all week, and she is wearing them.
我找了一個星期 她正穿著它

91
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:47,960
So she stole your pants and then came back and wore them in front of you?
她偷了你的褲子，然後回來 在你面前穿著它？

92
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:52,140
Don't you see? It's the perfect crime!
你不明白嗎？ 這是完美犯罪

93
00:06:52,410 --> 00:06:55,430
She must have been planning this for years!
她一定計劃了好幾年

94
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,940
I'll prove it to you, okay.
我會證明給你看的

95
00:06:57,210 --> 00:07:02,270
I dropped a pen in my lap, and it left an ink stain on the crotch.
我把筆掉在大腿上 在胯部留下了墨水印子

96
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:07,150
When she comes back, I will find it and show you that stain!
她回來後，我會找到它 讓你看看那個墨水印子

97
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:15,090
Isn't it possible the company that sold the jeans made more than just the one pair?
賣出那件牛仔褲的公司難道 只做了一件牛仔褲嗎？

98
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:16,490
I guess.
我猜你說的對

99
00:07:16,730 --> 00:07:22,800
Shouldn't we give her the benefit of the doubt before we snoop around her crotch?
我們應該先找找看 再去看她的胯部吧？

100
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:27,640
Fine. I'm just glad I didn't give her my secret ingredient.
好吧，我很高興 我沒有告訴她我的秘方

101
00:07:27,810 --> 00:07:30,240
Out of curiosity, what is your secret ingredient?
我真的很好奇 你的秘方是什麼？

102
00:07:30,410 --> 00:07:31,670
Yeah.
對

103
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:41,150
-Hi. -Come in. I'm so glad you're here.
-嗨 -請進，我很高興你來了

104
00:07:41,390 --> 00:07:42,410
Yeah. Me too.
對，我也是

105
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:45,990
Not in the shaky, angry way that you are, though.
但不像你 那麼震驚憤怒

106
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:50,460
Sorry. I just saw Ursula. I had to get the engagement ring back.
抱歉，我剛剛見過烏蘇拉 我得把訂婚戒指拿回來

107
00:07:50,670 --> 00:07:53,960
Just seeing her brought it all back.
看到她讓我想起一切

108
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:57,540
All the lies, the way she used me.
那些謊言，還有她是怎麼利用我的

109
00:07:57,810 --> 00:08:02,040
I just.. I get so angry, just looking at her..
我只是…光是看到她 我就覺得好生氣…

110
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:09,940
-Face. -Yeah. Yeah.
-我是說看到她的臉 -對

111
00:08:10,490 --> 00:08:15,350
I'm sorry. It's just, when I look at you..
抱歉 當我看到你…

112
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:17,650
I see her.
我就像是看到了她

113
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:23,500
And when I see her, I get a little bit angry.
我看到她時 會覺得很生氣

114
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:28,400
So where do you wanna eat?
你要去哪裡吃飯？

115
00:08:28,570 --> 00:08:31,470
Not that I'm not enjoying watching you flip out.
我不是不喜歡看著你發瘋

116
00:08:32,370 --> 00:08:34,340
Sorry.
抱歉

117
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:36,570
-Maybe this is too weird. -Wait.
-或許這太奇怪了 -等一下

118
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:41,370
There's only a problem when I look at you.
我看著你時 只會有一個問題

119
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:44,520
I got it. I got it.
我知道了

120
00:08:45,050 --> 00:08:47,820
No, don't tear out your eyes!
不，別把你的眼睛挖出來

121
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:52,690
-I was just gonna take out my lenses. -Oh, yeah. Try that.
-我只是要把隱形眼鏡拿掉 -好吧，試試看

122
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:57,460
So is that better?
那樣子好多了嗎？

123
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:59,720
Not really.
才怪

124
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:07,460
You're blurry, but you still look like Ursula. You're "Blursula."
你看起來很模糊，還是很像烏蘇拉 你是「模糊的烏蘇拉」

125
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:13,270
Okay, wait. Maybe..
好吧，等一下，或許…

126
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:17,880
If I just don't look at you for a while.
或許我該 暫時不要看你

127
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:25,580
See? It works. I'm not angry at all anymore. This is a great date!
看吧？成功了 我不再生氣，這是個很棒的約會

128
00:09:26,430 --> 00:09:28,260
Yeah, not so much.
對，沒那麼棒啦

129
00:09:28,730 --> 00:09:30,630
It's kind of hard to have a conversation.
那樣子很難說話

130
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:33,730
Oh, no. Sure, we can have a conversation.
不，當然，我們可以說話

131
00:09:34,970 --> 00:09:37,270
Tell me a little something about yourself.
跟我談談你自己

132
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,570
Oh, me?
我嗎？

133
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:44,540
Look, Eric, turn around.
聽著，艾力克，轉過來

134
00:09:46,050 --> 00:09:50,480
I like you, but it shouldn't be this hard. This is our first date.
我喜歡你，但它不應該這麼難 這是我們第一次約會

135
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:54,120
First dates are supposed to be about excitement and electricity and..
第一次約會應該是 刺激，火花四射…

136
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:59,890
"He just touched my hand, did he mean to?" and first kisses..
「他剛剛摸了我的手 他是有意的嗎？」，還有初吻…

137
00:10:01,930 --> 00:10:04,330
Second kisses.
第二次接吻

138
00:10:07,230 --> 00:10:10,600
Thanks for the coffee, or:
謝謝你的咖啡

139
00:10:10,343 --> 00:10:13,574
（荷蘭語）

140
00:10:14,013 --> 00:10:18,074
（荷蘭語）

141
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:23,510
Yeah, we're done.
對，我們喝完了

142
00:10:24,156 --> 00:10:26,124
（荷蘭語）

143
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:35,420
Hey, Ross. You wanna go see that new lMAX movie on tide pools?
羅斯，你要去人工造浪池 看新的立體電影嗎？

144
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:37,720
-Really? -No.
-真的嗎？ -不

145
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:42,500
But I got Knicks tickets for you, me and Chandler.
但我幫你，我跟錢德 弄到了尼克隊的門票

146
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:44,100
Sweet!
太棒了

147
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:46,540
And then afterwards, we can go to a strip joint.
之後我們可以去脫衣舞酒店

148
00:10:46,710 --> 00:10:48,570
-Really? -No.
-真的嗎？ -不

149
00:10:50,310 --> 00:10:51,800
All right, let's go.
好吧，我們走

150
00:10:52,210 --> 00:10:53,910
I have to stop by my place.
我得先回家一趟

151
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:59,520
To tape the game? You do this every time. You're not gonna be on TV!
你要錄球賽嗎？你每次都這麼做 你又沒有要上電視

152
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:02,620
No, I have to see if this apartment became available.
不，我得去看看 那間公寓是不是空下來了

